      "markdown": "## B Do a survey\n\nPlease interview your friends and find out what they would like to do on special days.\n\n\n\nWhat's your favourite special day?\n\nWhat would you like todo?\n\nMy favourite special day is Teachers' Day. It's comingsoon.I'dlike tobuy someflowers and make a card for my teacher.\n\nWould you like to make a phone call or send a message?\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_927_1323_1467_1861.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"21%\" /></div>\n\n\nI'd like to call her.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1524_1250_2173_1872.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"26%\" /></div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><html><body><table border=\"1\"><tr><td>name</td><td>Bill</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>special day</td><td>Teachers'Day</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>things he/she would like to do</td><td>buy some flowers make a card make a phone call</td><td></td><td></td></tr></table></body></html></div>\n\n\n## C Let's write\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_352_2595_703_2973.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"14%\" /></div>\n\n\nWhat would you like to do on Spring Festival?",
